From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:22:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/45] dt-bindings: serial: ingenic: Add X2600

The UARTs of the Ingenic X2600 are those of the X1000: 64-byte FIFOs and
the same registers. Document their compatible, with the X1000 one as
fallback.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml
index d5f153bde..ef9161a88 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/ingenic,uart.yaml
@@ -35,6 +35,9 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - const: ingenic,jz4755-uart
           - const: ingenic,jz4750-uart
+      - items:
+          - const: ingenic,x2600-uart
+          - const: ingenic,x1000-uart
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
